{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T14:02:57.320Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"39f0409326ff3a93bdf4de17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-8dbagz","lineage:pm-8dbagz","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-8dbagz","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-8dbagz","lineage:pm-8dbagz","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T14:02:57.320Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-28T14:02:57.319Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Reproduced and fixed (2026-11-28). The reproduction: schema.files.statuses names a directory, so readSettings falls back with settings_read_merge_failed and no custom field is active, and the fields file stores {key: full, commands: [list]}, which shadows pm list --full. A mutateWorkspaceSettings proposal that only repairs the statuses path resolved changed: true on main. Its before and after effective sets were equal, because both were computed as if hydration had succeeded. Fix: the settings read's hydration step was extracted into hydrateMergedSettings(pmRoot, merged) in core/store/settings.ts. readSettings calls it, and the writer calls it for the current and the persisted settings. A side that does not hydrate contributes no effective definitions, so a repair makes every stored definition newly effective and each is judged, while a proposal that leaves hydration failing judges none. The proposal's own new or changed inline definitions are judged in both cases, as before. The negative control is the same spec against main's extension-command-context.ts, which fails with promise resolved instead of rejecting."}]}],"before_hash":"4683d5561bf02f49102c6b1a96066de6f4bc799bdf30672ecc0fccb0da94a5b0","after_hash":"14a8082b3d2ecd7a2e20fa3e05546ba03af85b30a519d08aa5cf8781fb7bb3cd","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"cd1de027e8e4710e0ad7d90132fa0dc1e96da53431c60b1e5d5f3e7b134caacb"}
