{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-28T14:45:16.943Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"39f0409326ff3a93bdf4de17","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-928ng6","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-928ng6","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-28T14:45:16.943Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 1 (2026-11-28), P2, valid: a schema path naming a POSIX FIFO with no writer stalled hydrateMergedSettings under the workspace lock. fs.readFile blocks on a pipe, and the ordinary settings read hung the same way for every command. Schema files are now read with readOptionalRegularFile (core/fs/fs-utils.ts): a non-blocking open, absent reads as null, and anything but a regular file throws, so a pipe fails hydration like a directory. The spec repairs a FIFO-backed statuses path through mutateWorkspaceSettings (dry run, refused for the stored shadowing field) without stalling, and the reader's own spec covers a regular file, an absent file, a directory, a FIFO and EACCES."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-28T14:45:16.943Z"}],"before_hash":"a0f5f387fe7c1f6433a0cdcafe7aee5528d7efe4e46a0cc38b461fa69ebaff05","after_hash":"3aeea2eb539ece78fe1c2be37d188eb23f922df1bada9b731416c5d09b264a05","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session